WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.560
What happens when a veggie&nbsp;
burrito is placed into SCP-914?

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:10.400
Dr. Hort decided to see if SCP-914 could&nbsp;
transform some kinds of energy into others.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.280
Music was played at 120 decibels inside&nbsp;
the input chamber before starting 914,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.360
with the objective of cooking a&nbsp;
burrito using the kinetic sound energy.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.080
Then, the burrito was placed inside on the&nbsp;
setting “fine.” This was the output produced:

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.480
“A burrito filled with smashed vegetables.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:31.360
A bright flash of over 9.500 lumens was&nbsp;
visible when the output chamber opened,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:36.400
injuring the retina of D-7438 (who was used&nbsp;
to open the output chamber) permanently.”

